			"notes": "Updated to 1.16.2! Everything should work (basically) as it did previously. Please let any issues be known through the issues tab.\n\nSince the state of customizable world generation is... unfinished to state it mildly, this mod does a series of *very* gross things in order to make everything winter. This is disable-able in the config if you want to play around with custom world generation and are confused why everything is converted to winter against your wishes (although if you're using this mod... you really shouldn't be 😉)\n\nDecided to go ahead without waiting for forge PRs. 2/5 Port job would not do again. Forge please make my life easier and merge some PRs thanks in advance. Thank you tterrag for yarn2mcp that was invaluable.\n\n### Edit 2020-09-10:\n\nThis build works on 1.16.3, there will be no specific release for that version although all future releases will be 1.16.3 specific."
